        "content": [
          "Most words in this pack evolved over",
          "centuries. From here, many were",
          "built on purpose, in a single sitting,",
          "by a scientist naming something new.",
          "",
          "Chemists reached for Greek roots:",
          "oxygen (oxy, sharp) and hydrogen",
          "(hydro, water) were both coined this",
          "way, along with chromium and lithium.",
          "",
          "The metric system did the same for",
          "scale: kilo- (thousand), mega-",
          "(great), micro- (small) — one root,",
          "one size, no ambiguity.",
          "",
          "Greek gave science a precise,",
          "borrowing-proof vocabulary."
